  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Limitless — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>A technique whose power is only matched by its complexity,<br />\n Limitless allows manipulation over space.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, you gain the ability to use your manipulation over space to protect yourself effectively. As a bonus action for 1 Cursed Energy, you can encase yourself in a field of mathematical infinity costing 1 Cursed Energy at the start of your turn. When you are targeted by a weapon, spell, Cursed Energy attack roll or any saving throws from sources outside your body you roll a d6. On a 4 or higher, any attacks or spells made against you automatically fail to touch or harm you in any physical way. At 6th level, this becomes 3 or higher, and 2 or higher at 11th level.<br />\n You can spend 1 Cursed Energy to automatically roll a 6 on an Infinity roll. At 11th level, you can spend 2 Cursed Energy at the beginning of each of your turns to automatically roll a 6 on Infinity rolls and you can activate Infinity as a reaction to being targeted by an attack or effect that you can see.<br />\n When you take the Dodge action while Infinity is activated, you gain advantage on the d6 roll, and you can grant its benefits to any creatures within your reach.<br />\nThis feature does not work against poison or attacks that you cannot see until 6th level.  </p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
